  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at 100b6fbb6e: setup.py:418 (managed block) and 466-467 (policy template) still ship holding/wontfix. Correction: on a temp tracker from config.yaml.template, 'update --status wontfix' is accepted (exit 0) and only 'validate' rejects it later (exit 1, unknown status). 'holding' is deprecated only for invariants. 'update --status bogus_status' also exits 0, an unvalidated-write gap worth its own item. MECHANISM: shipped governance prose hand-copies a drifted status vocabulary; update --status does not validate against configured statuses. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-dolaf."  # d541
